      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is the right way to do this:\n\n1. quiche should not be including the NULs in the tracing report - it almost certainly meant to truncate them off. It\u0027s not against the preconditions to include NULs there, but they probably didn\u0027t mean to.\n2. If `android_logger` can\u0027t render `\u0026str`s with internal nulls, it should probably be handling this at a higher layer of the stack, not during the flush, possibly by replacing NUL with some other codepoint.",
